        "created_at": "2015-04-13T04:19:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a game once that started with Blood, Sweat, and Tears. I died horribly in that one. For me, the hardest games with Dawn are when Tears comes out early and then refuses to stay dead because of Return with the Dawn. Combine tears with Blinding Blast, and nobody has any cards. I actually hate Tears more than Truth.</p>",
